
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#123c69">
<title>SomaHub | CBC Revision Centre</title>
<style>
:root{--blue:#123c69;--teal:#087e8b;--light:#f2f6fb;--ink:#1d2939;--muted:#667085;--line:#dce4ed}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--light);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 Arial,sans-serif}
header{background:var(--blue);color:white;padding:22px 16px}
header .wrap,main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:27px}
header p{margin:5px 0 0;color:#e2edfa}
nav{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
nav a{color:white;border:1px solid #ffffff70;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 11px;text-decoration:none}
main{padding:18px 12px 40px}
.card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:17px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px #102a4308}
h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--blue)}
h3{font-size:17px;margin:8px 0}
.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(155px,1fr));gap:12px}
label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px}
select,input{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #c8d2df;border-radius:8px;background:white;font:inherit}
button{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 15px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.primary{background:var(--teal);color:white}
.secondary{background:#e7eef7;color:var(--blue)}
.actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:13px}
.question{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:14px;margin:12px 0}
.question p{margin:5px 0 10px}
.option{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-weight:400;padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer}
.option input{width:auto;margin-top:5px}
.feedback{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:9px;background:#eef5ff}
.correct{color:#116b43;font-weight:700}
.wrong{color:#a12626;font-weight:700}
.pill{display:inline-block;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f0fa;padding:3px 9px;font-size:12px;margin:2px}
#results,#paper{margin-top:15px}
.paper-head{text-align:center}
.paper-question{margin:16px 0;break-inside:avoid}
.paper-question ol{margin-top:5px}
.answer-key{border-top:2px dashed #9aa8b8;margin-top:25px;padding-top:15px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
@media print{
 body{background:white;font-size:12pt}
 header,nav,.no-print,#setup,#quizControls,footer{display:none!important}
 main{max-width:none;padding:0}
 .card{border:0;box-shadow:none;padding:0}
 #paper{display:block!important}
 .paper-question{break-inside:avoid}
 .answer-key{break-before:page}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
 <div class="wrap">
  <h1>📚 SomaHub Revision Centre</h1>
  <p>Grade 7–9 CBC practice • Quizzes • Practice papers • Answer explanations</p>
  <nav>
   <a href="index.html">SomaHub Home</a>
   <a href="#quiz">Take a Quiz</a>
   <a href="#generator">Practice Papers</a>
  </nav>
 </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="card" id="setup">
 <h2>Choose your revision area</h2>
 <p class="muted">Select a grade, learning area and topic. Leave the topic on “All topics” to mix questions. This starter bank contains original practice questions, not official KNEC examination papers.</p>
 <div class="filters">
  <div><label for="grade">Grade</label>
   <select id="grade"><option value="7">Grade 7</option><option value="8">Grade 8</option><option value="9">Grade 9</option></select>
  </div>
  <div><label for="subject">Subject</label>
   <select id="subject">
    <option>Mathematics</option><option>English</option><option>Kiswahili</option>
    <option>Integrated Science</option><option>Social Studies</option>
    <option>Agriculture and Nutrition</option><option>Pre-Technical Studies</option>
    <option>Creative Arts and Sports</option><option>CRE</option><option>IRE</option>
    <option>HRE</option><option>French</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div><label for="topic">Topic</label><select id="topic"><option value="all">All topics</option></select></div>
  <div><label for="difficulty">Difficulty</label>
   <select id="difficulty"><option value="all">All levels</option><option>Easy</option><option>Medium</option><option>Challenge</option></select>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class="actions">
  <button class="primary" id="startQuiz">Start randomized quiz</button>
  <button class="secondary" id="refreshQuestions">Shuffle questions</button>
 </div>
 <p id="bankCount" class="muted" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>

<section class="card" id="quiz">
 <h2>Interactive quiz</h2>
 <p class="muted">Choose one answer per question. Submit to see your score, correct answers and explanations.</p>
 <div id="quizArea"><p>Select your revision area above, then tap “Start randomized quiz”.</p></div>
 <div id="quizControls" class="actions"></div>
 <div id="results" aria-live="polite"></div>
</section>

<section class="card" id="generator">
 <h2>Practice-paper generator</h2>
 <p>Generate a printable practice paper from the selected grade, subject, topic and difficulty.</p>
 <div class="filters">
  <div><label for="paperCount">Number of questions</label>
   <select id="paperCount"><option>5</option><option selected>10</option><option>15</option><option>20</option></select>
  </div>
  <div><label for="includeAnswers">Answer guide</label>
   <select id="includeAnswers"><option value="yes">Include answer guide</option><option value="no">Questions only</option></select>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class="actions no-print">
  <button class="primary" id="makePaper">Generate practice paper</button>
  <button class="secondary" id="printPaper">Print / Save as PDF</button>
 </div>
 <div id="paper"></div>
</section>

<section class="card">
 <h2>About this question bank</h2>
 <p>Questions are original learning exercises designed for revision. Coverage is currently a starter collection, not a complete syllabus or a verified official examination archive. Teachers should check questions against the current KICD curriculum design before formal classroom assessment.</p>
 <p class="muted">For curriculum designs, visit the <a href="https://kicd.ac.ke/cbc-materials/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official KICD CBC materials page</a>.</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer>SomaHub • Learn together, grow together</footer>

